      "p0001-n0021-l0002"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "We additionally contrive a new method of collision avoidance. The advan- tages of traditional \u201dbox\u201d method and the \u201dcollisional probability\u201d method are incorporated in our new method."
  }
